      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear your weight and gratitude, and I would not amend such a profound ache for a victory that cannot be won. You have carried the burden of command with a honesty that may one day bring peace to you. Though this moment is heavy, let the camp rest so that you may begin to find quiet in the ashes.",
